    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      490.59,
      298.2,
      557.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      574.59,
      298.2,
      697.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land described morefully in the Advance Tracing No. B/HLD/2021/585 dated 31.03.2022, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village called Weerakoonagama (F.V.P. 289) in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 158 G of Weerakoonagama in the Minor Division of Kandapalla Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Haldummulla in the District of Badulla in Uva Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.15,
      443.46,
      549.67,
      532.53
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Weerakoongamapathana \u2013 Extent: 0.2023 Hectare North: Lot No. 11C of F.V.P. 289; East: Lot Nos. 11C and 11 of F.V.P. 289 (Weerakoongamapathana claimed by R. W. D. T. Rajasekara); South and West: Lot No. 11 of F.V.P. 289 (Weerakoongamapathana claimed by R. W. D. T. Rajasekara).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
